    "writing_style_notes": "Fun, energetic, confident, warm, science-backed but never clinical. Philosophy: 'This isn't hype. It's hydration.' Burleson doesn't do boring. And neither do we. The DRIPBaR Burleson is the healthiest bar in town. Where wellness meets energy. Where recovery meets community. Where every visit feels like you showed up to something good. Burleson ladies are a vibe. Every visit feels like a party. But behind the fun is serious functional health. You can come in tired and leave energized. Functional health is proactive. Not reactive. We don't wait for problems. We support your body before they start. It's nutrient optimization. It's cellular support. It just happens to be a really good time, too."
